#: apps/disks/data/org.helixdesktop.Disks.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Disks shows the drives and media connected to the computer, their partitions "
"and their health. Format, partition, mount, encrypt and check volumes, "
"attach disk images and read SMART data."
